
@entry place.hub.player-home
  @scene place.player-home
  @place-key player_home
  @hub place
@endentry

:: place.player-home [place hub]
@kind place
@heading "Home"
@choices "Activities"

You are back in the privacy of {{place.name}}.

@choice rest "Go to Bed" -> place.player-home
  @icon 🛏️
  @time 8h free
  @effect stat energy +75
@endchoice

@choice chores "Do some chores" -> place.player-home
  @icon 🧹
  @time 30m
  @effect stat energy -10
  @effect stat hygiene 10
  
@endchoice

@choice lift-weights "Lift weights" -> place.player-home
  @icon 🏋️
  @time 5m
  @when not daily.home_weightlifting
  @effect skill strength 0.1
  @effect daily-flag home_weightlifting true
@endchoice

@choice open-jar "Open a stubborn jar"
  @icon 🫙
  @check skill strength tricky

  @success -> home.jar-opened
    @time 1m
    @effect flag jar_opened true
  @endsuccess

  @failure -> home.jar-stuck
    @time 1m
    @effect flag jar_opened false
  @endfailure
@endchoice

@choice leave "Leave" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice

:: home.jar-opened [event home skill-check]
@heading "The stubborn jar"

The lid gives way with a sharp pop. You set the opened jar down with quiet satisfaction.

@choice back "Put the jar away" -> place.player-home
@endchoice

:: home.jar-stuck [event home skill-check]
@heading "The stubborn jar"

You twist until your palm aches, but the lid refuses to move.

@choice back "Put the jar back" -> place.player-home
@endchoice
